## Always-on edge cases

- Double click / double tap on anything that saves or pays
- Two tabs saving the same thing
- Empty, too long, wrong-format input; names with accents, emoji and apostrophes
- Slow or no network; server error
- Expired links and sessions; Back button in the middle of a flow
- Opening a page by its address without permission, or another user's record by changing the id
- Time zones and dates (saved a day early or late; month ends; leap years)
- Same account signed in on two devices
{{#if has_payments}}
- Payment declined, then retried; paying twice; refunds
{{/if}}
{{#if has_api}}
- API: no token, expired token, wrong role, another customer's data, the same request twice
{{/if}}
{{#if has_locales}}
- Long translated text that doesn't fit; dates, numbers and currency per language
{{/if}}
